[[Banished Dream Rider]]s are spectral horsemen and powerful [[mesmer]]s that can be seen wandering the [[Chaos Planes]] in [[the Underworld]] as well as [[the Rift]]. They are servants of [[Dhuum]].

In the Underworld they sometimes appear to be alone, but their deaths will spawn a group of three [[Mindblade Spectre]]s. Killing those Mindblades will then be followed by a new spawn of six Mindblades and then further on by a spawn of nine Mindblades. Some Banished Dream Riders can also be found in groups of two with a [[Wailing Lord (The Underworld)|Wailing Lord]]. When in a group Banished Dream Riders do not spawn Mindblades.

In the ruins of the [[Tomb of the Primeval Kings]] they can be found accompanied by [[Terrorweb Dryder]]s, [[Scythe of Chaos|Scythes of Chaos]] and [[Grasp of Insanity|Grasps of Insanity]]. These Banished Dream Riders do not spawn Mindblade Spectres.

